<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body class="bg-gray-50 text-gray-900">   

    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>
    
    <main>
        <header class="relative bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900 via-blue-800 to-blue-700 pt-32 pb-20 px-6 text-center text-white overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full opacity-10 pointer-events-none">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 200 200" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-full h-full">
                    <path fill="#FFFFFF" d="M44.7,-76.4C58.8,-69.2,71.8,-59.1,79.6,-46.2C87.4,-33.3,90,-16.7,89.1,-0.5C88.2,15.6,83.8,31.2,75.4,44.7C67,58.2,54.7,69.5,40.6,76.4C26.5,83.3,10.6,85.8,-4.2,85.1C-19,84.4,-32.7,80.5,-45.5,73C-58.3,65.5,-70.2,54.4,-77.8,40.9C-85.4,27.4,-88.7,11.5,-87.3,-3.8C-85.9,-19.1,-79.8,-33.8,-70.1,-45.9C-60.4,-58.1,-47.1,-67.7,-33.1,-74.9C-19.1,-82.1,-4.5,-86.9,9.8,-85.2C24.1,-83.5,30.6,-83.6,44.7,-76.4Z" transform="translate(100 100)" />
                </svg>
            </div>

            <div class="container mx-auto relative z-10">
                <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 mb-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider text-blue-100 uppercase bg-blue-600 rounded-full bg-opacity-50">
                    Próxima Generación de Retail
                </span>
                <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold mb-6 leading-tight">
                    Digitaliza tus estantes con <br> <span class="text-blue-300">Etiquetas electrónicas inteligentes</span>
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl mb-10 max-w-2xl mx-auto opacity-90 font-light">
                    Tecnología de vanguardia para tu negocio.
                </p>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 mt-10">
                    <a href="#pasos" class="bg-white text-blue-900 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-center">
                        Saber más
                    </a>
                    <a href="#contacto" class="bg-blue-600 text-white border border-blue-400 px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-blue-500 transition shadow-lg transform hover:-translate-y-1 text-center">
                        Solicitar Demo
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <section id="pasos" class="relative py-24 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-blue-900 to-blue-700 opacity-95 z-0"></div>
            
            <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-20">
                    <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1 mb-6 text-xs font-mono font-bold tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-300 uppercase border border-blue-500/30 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10">
                        Ahorro: Cero costos de impresión y etiquetado
                    </span>
                    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 italic tracking-tight">
                        El Camino a la Eficiencia
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-xl text-blue-100 opacity-90 leading-relaxed">
                        Tres pasos simples para <span class="text-blue-300 font-semibold">automatizar</span> tus estantes.
                    </p> 
                </div> 
                <section id="tecnologia" class="container mx-auto py-16 px-4">
                    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-12">
                        <div class="md:w-1/2">
                            <img src="/images/grafico.jpg" alt="Sistema SmartLabels" class="rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-blue-50 hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500">
                        </div>
                        
                        <div class="md:w-1/2">
                            <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">Control Total en Tiempo Real</h2>
                            <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">
                                Nuestra arquitectura conecta tus góndolas directamente con la nube, permitiendo cambios de precios masivos en segundos.
                            </p>
                            <ul class="space-y-3 text-blue-600 font-medium">
                                <li>✓ Sincronización Nube-Hub</li>
                                <li>✓ Actualización instantánea de etiquetas</li>
                                <li>✓ Optimización de inventario</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
                    <div class="group bg-white bg-opacity-10 backdrop-blur-lg p-8 rounded-3xl border border-blue-400 border-opacity-30 hover:bg-opacity-20 transition-all duration-300">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white text-blue-800 text-3xl font-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl transform group-hover:scale-110 transition">1</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Hardware Expressif y Pantallas CYD 2.8</h3>
                        <p class="text-blue-50">
                            Gestiona inteligentemente hasta 10 productos por display. <span class="font-bold text-blue-200">Espacio optimizado y máximo impacto</span>. Diseño compacto y montaje rápido.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="group bg-white bg-opacity-10 backdrop-blur-lg p-8 rounded-3xl border border-blue-400 border-opacity-30 hover:bg-opacity-20 transition-all duration-300">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white text-blue-800 text-3xl font-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl transform group-hover:scale-110 transition">2</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Control total en la nube</h3>
                        <p class="text-blue-50">
                            Acceso a base de datos Online. Gestiona precios y sincroniza con tu estante con un click desde nuestro panel web intuitivo.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="group bg-white bg-opacity-10 backdrop-blur-lg p-8 rounded-3xl border border-blue-400 border-opacity-30 hover:bg-opacity-20 transition-all duration-300">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-white text-blue-800 text-3xl font-black rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-xl transform group-hover:scale-110 transition">3</div>
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Publicidad en movimiento</h3>
                        <p class="text-blue-50">
                            Es una pantalla publicitaria. Proyecta videos promocionales y capta la atención en el punto de venta.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="contacto" class="py-24 bg-white">
            <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl">
                <div class="p-8 md:p-12 bg-gray-50 rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100">
                    <h4 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2 text-center">Solicitar presupuesto</h4> 
                    <p class="text-center text-gray-600 mb-10">Déjanos tus datos y nos pondremos en contacto para una demo técnica.</p>
                    
                    <form action="https://formspree.io/f/xwvrajev" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Nombre Completo</label>
                            <input type="text" name="nombre" required placeholder="Ej. Hector Rojas"
                                class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:border-transparent outline-none transition">
                        </div>

                        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Correo Electrónico</label>
                                <input type="email" name="email" required placeholder="tu@email.com"
                                    class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:border-transparent outline-none transition">
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Empresa / Tienda</label>
                                <input type="text" name="empresa" placeholder="Nombre de tu negocio"
                                    class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 focus:border-transparent outline-none transition">
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Interés principal</label>
                            <select name="interes" class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 outline-none bg-white">
                                <option value="etiquetas-5en1">Etiquetas Inteligentes</option>
                                <option value="video-mjpeg">Publicidad en Video</option>
                                <option value="desarrollo-especial">Desarrollo a medida</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>

                        <div>
                            <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-1">Mensaje</label>
                            <textarea name="mensaje" rows="4" required placeholder="¿En qué podemos ayudarte?"
                                class="w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-blue-600 outline-none transition"></textarea>
                        </div>

                        <button type="submit" 
                            class="w-full bg-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-800 text-white font-bold py-4 rounded-xl transition-all shadow-lg transform hover:scale-[1.01] active:scale-95">
                            Enviar consulta técnica
                        </button>
                        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://tu-web.onrender.com/gracias">
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <button id="toTop" class="fixed bottom-8 right-8 bg-blue-600 text-white p-3 rounded-full shadow-2xl opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-300 z-50 hover:bg-blue-700">
        <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 10l7-7m0 0l7 7m-7-7v18"></path>
        </svg>
    </button>

    <script>
        const toTopBtn = document.getElementById('toTop');
        window.onscroll = function() {
            if (document.body.scrollTop > 500 || document.documentElement.scrollTop > 500) {
                toTopBtn.classList.remove('opacity-0');
            } else {
                toTopBtn.classList.add('opacity-0');
            }
        };
        toTopBtn.onclick = function() {
            window.scrollTo({ top: 0, behavior: 'smooth' });
        };
    </script>
</body>
</html>